<p. 1a> śrī gaṇeśāya nama || 

vaśyākarṣana karmmāni vasaṃte yojayet prīya |
grīṣme vidvekhanaṃ kāryyaṃ prāvṛṣi staṃbhanaṃ tathā || 1 ||

śiśire māranaṃ caiva sāṃtikaṃ saradi smṛtaṃ ||
hemante pauṣṭika kuryyāt ṛtukarma visāradaḥ || 2 ||

vaśaṃte caiva pūrvāhne grīṣmo madhyāhna ucyate |
varṣāṇī(?) yā parāhne tu pradokhe sisira smṛta || 3 ||

arddharātrau saratkāla ukhāhe manta ucyate || 
ritavaṃ yatkathi hete sarvvo ye tatkramena ca || 4 ||

<p. 1b> tatvat hīnā na kurvvaṃti prayatnenāpi kurvataḥ ||
ananya karanātyahi(?) dhruvaddhyanti nānyathā || 5 ||

iti ṛtu nirṇaya || 

atha tithi nirṇaya ||

vaśikaraṇa karmmāni saptamyāṃ kāraye budha ||
trītiyāyāṃ trayodaśyāṃ tathā karṣaṇa karmma vai || 6 ||

ucāṭanaṃ dutiyāyāṃṣṭyāṃ caiva prasodhayet ||
staṃbhanaṃ ca catudaśyāṃ caturthyāṃ pratipadyapi || 7 ||

mohanaṃstu navamyāṃ ca tathāṣṭammyāṃ prayojayet ||
dvādaśyāṃ māraṇaṃ sastaṃ ekādaśyāṃ tathaiva ca || 8 ||

pancamyāṃ pūṇīmāyāṃ ca yojayet dvāṃtikādikaṃ ||
<p. 2a> sarvvavidyā prasiddhyarthaṃ tithaya kathitā kramāt || 9 ||

īti || 

atha nakṣatranirṇaya ||
staṃbhanaṃ mohanaṃ caiva vaśīkaraṇamuttamaṃ ||
māhendra vāruṇi caiva kartavyamiha siddhidaṃ || 10 ||

vidveṣeccāṭanaṃ vahni vāyuyogena kārayet | 
jyeṣṭhā caivottarāṣāḍhā anurārādhā ca rohiṇī || 11 || 

māhendra maṇḍalaṣṭā ca proktā karmaprasiddhidā |
syāduttara bhādrapadā mūlā śatabhiṣā tathā || 12 ||

pūrvvabhādrapadāśleṣā jñeyā vārūmadhyagā |
<p. 2b> pūrvvāṣāḍhā ca tat karmma siddhidā saṃbhūnā smṛtā || 13 ||

svāti hastā mṛgaśilā citrā cottara phālguṇi |
puṣpā punarvasu vahni maṇḍalasthā prakirtitā || 14 ||

asunibharucitrādhaniṣṭāśramaṇā maghā ||
viśāṣā kṛtikā pūrvva phālguṇī revati tathā || 15 ||

vāruṇamaṇḍalamadhyasthā tadṛta karmma prasi (*) dā || 

īti ||

atha aguṣṭādi niṇaya ||

śāntike pauṣṭīke caiva abhicāraka karmmaṇi || 16 ||

<p. 3a> tarjjanyādi samārūḍhaṃ kuryyā yathā kramaṃ sudhi ||
tathāguṣṭhasamārūḍhaṃ sarvvakarmma subhetare || 17 ||

īti ||

atha vauṣadhanirṇaya ||

vidhimaṃtrasamāyuktaṃ auṣaḍhaṃ saphalaṃ bhavet ||
vidhimaṃtra vihinaṃ tu kāṣṭavat bhekhajaṃ bhavet || 18 ||

yakānte tu śubhārarayo tiṣṭate ca jadauṣadhaṃ || 
kāryyasiddhi bhave tasya virjamasti ca tatra vai || 19 ||

vālmika kupa tarū tanara īti 

<p. 3b> atha auṣadhagrahaṇavidhi ||
ādau gatvā vṛkṣamūlaṃ saṃyojya cābhimaṃtritaṃ || 20 ||

guguli auṣadhaliyajula oguli simākosava ṅā vasimāyā hāthiyāvathomaṃtra 
paḍalape || maṃtra ||

oṃ vetālāśca piśācā rākṣasāśca sariśrīpā 
apasarpyaṃtu te sarvva vṛkṣodaśyā chivā geyā ||

thote maṃtra voṅāva hātha jojala pāva namaskāra yāṅāvatāthe ||

<p. 4a> atha liyasapaḍalape matra ||
oṃ namonte mṛta saṃbhūte balaviryya vivardhani 
balamāyuśca me dehi pāpān mā hi durata jena tvāṃ khanate brahmāṃ jena 
tvāṃ khanate bhṛgu jena indrotha varuṇa tena tvāṃ upacakrame tena tvāṃ 
khanayikhyāmi maṃtra putena pāninā uśapātite mā ca tejo nethā bhavet | atraiva 
tiṣṭha kalpāni mama kārjakari bhava mama kārja kṛśe sidhe tata sorggaṃ gamiṣesi 
||

<p. 4b> atha liyayāta maṃtra ||
oṃ hrīṁ caṇḍa hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || thomaṃtrana ādityavāra athavā puṣpanakṣatra 
athavā puṣpaṃ ādityavāratho khunuliye || 
atha hādhena maṃtra ||
oṃ hrīṁ phaṭ svāhā || atha vandakāya maṃtra || 
oṃ baladaṃḍa mahādaṃḍa svāhā khatrīyāla mālinī svāhā || pratyekaṃ 
saptadhā japet ||

<p. 5a> oṃ aṁ reṁ toṁ vaṁ tiṁ reṁ roṁ daṁ iṁ kāṁ gaṁ yoṁ goṁ ḍaṁ taṁ yoṁ cāṁ pāṁ paṁ siṁ ciṁ riṁ 
gāṁ ḍaiṁ paṁ siṁ phoṁ riṁ gāṁ ḍaṁ iśvara mahādeva kivācā gaurī pārvvatī kivācā 
choṁ daṁ vaṁ hiṁ rāṁ choṁ daṁ (2) hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || 
atha karūṇa matra || oṃ karūṇa phate (10) avarutrarale phaṭ svāhā || īti || 
oṃ devī suri guru ājñābhimasenayā ājñā || thomaṃtranapyākhana senakalasā 
thomaṃtra vonesena kuhma phekatuye maphasyaṃdaṅāvaconi ca || 
oṃ indrajāla suthāmaṃtra muru mahāvarī devī
oṃ coravā vāraṇa vyāghra pyajānyā siddhi guru ājñā || 
dhāratyā

<p. 5b> phimaṃtrayā ṅā vapyadigasaṃśayada vulisa ||
oṃ akāsayogiṇī oṃ huṁ mahā ājñā huṁ phaṭ || dhāra 108 māsamaṃtrayā ṅā 
vahvaleda vuliśakhiṃ pvālakhane ||
oṃ satye sā chigva kuladhyā pādhochāra pādhochārasi uti āyoparatigayo rhuṁ 
guru oṃ lelevetapāthi svāhā || dhāra (5) tho maṃtra namevanapyāṣana senakasātho 
maṃtra ceka tava hākala vakāyāvatha ca pālāhāti sa ketakā ca musyāla

<p. 6a> śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || athābhrabījaṃ || abhrabījaṃ ca jīmūta maṃbu 
vṛdava laṃghanaṃ || vaṃ bījāni ca paṃcaiva manṛtānyaparāṇi tu || vīṁ || 1 || athā 
| phro bījaṃ || ābddhibījaṃ tathā siṃdhra sāvavaṃsāgarastathā ||
rūṃ bījāni ca catvāri kṛttimānya parāṇi ca || rūṁ || 2 ||

atha kalpabījaṃ ||
kalpabījaṃ ca saṃvarttaṃ pralayaṃ kṣaya bījakaṃ || 
kṣāmakaṃ kṣurakaṃ kṣaudraṃ tathā kalpāṃta bījakaṃ || 
dhvaṃ bījānye ca muṣṇau ca kṛttimānya parāni ca || dhruṁ ||

<p. 7a> oṃ kṣiṁ kṣauṁ mohaya || atha maṃtratrayavāra jāpāṃ mohamākṣoti vaijanā || 
(???)

<p. 8a> sana hūṁ phaṭ svāhā || iti ṣaḍaṃgāni || karadvayāṃguṣṭhya 
kaniṣṭhātāṃgulī maṃtra varṇān vinyasya | pādakaṭi hṛdayavaktra mūrdhasu ca 
paṃcapaṃcavarṇān vinyasyet || dhyānaṃ ||

<p. 9a> śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || tato maṃtraprayogamāha ||

dhruvaṃthāṃtaṃ binduyuktaṃ dakṣakarṇaṃ vibhūṣitaṃ | 
astramaṃtraṃ samudhṛtya maṃtraṃ paṃcākṣari smṛtaṃ ||

jayāgre sa tu jāpena jayo bhavati nānyathā |
jaya nāma hṛdi nyasya cakṣukhātaṃni eva ca ||

hṛdaye sparśa jāpena tatkṣaṇāt prajayeddarin ||
prakāśa ||
oṃ daṃ uṁ phaṭ ||1||

<p. 9b> krodhīśaṃ vahnisaṃyuktaṃ oṃra śirasaṃyutaṃ |
pavanaṃ vahni saṃyuktaṃ oṃkāra śirasaṃyutaṃ || 

bījadvayamidaṃ maṃtraṃ trailokye ca sudurllabhaṃ |
nirāmiṣānna bhoktā ca japtavyo maṃtramuttamaṃ || 

asādhyoyopi rājā ca putramitrāni bāṃdhavā | 
janmagotra samūhena yasya yasyāni sarvvataḥ ||

te sarve vasyatāṃ yāti saha śrārddhasya jāpataḥ |

<p. 10a> prakāśa || kroṁ proṁ || 5001 || 2 ||
tato vyāghra staṃbhanaṃ ||

māyāyugmaṃ tato lakṣmī jyotirbījaṃ tadaṃtake |
hiṁ ehiśca padaṃ brūyāt maṃtroyaṃ saptadakṣarī ||

mitimaṃtrena roṣṭhaṃ ca maṃtrayitvā catu diśe |
nikṣipet bhavati staṃbhaṃ vyāghrānāṃ ca na śaṃsayaḥ || 3 ||

asya prakāśa || hrīṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hiṁ ehi ||

<p. 10b> tato maṃtrānāṃ kīlakoddhāravidhi || 
padmakāṣṭa praṃcāṃgula pramātena kīlakaṃ gṛhitvā śodhanaṃ karttavyaṃ ||

maṃtraṃ yathā ||
aiṁ hrīṁ śrīṁ hphreṁ hsauṁ haṃsa aiṁ klīṁ sauṁ hūṁ saiṁ saṁ haiṁ yaṁ raṁ laṁ saṁ khhphruṁ yaṁ 
raṁ laṁ vaṁ aṁ kaṁ caṁ ṭaṁ taṁ paṁ yaṁ saṁ tatra sthala pūrvvakṛta kīlakaṃ nāśaya (2) mama 
kṛtasya kīlakasya siddhiṃ dehi (2) maṃtrasiddhiṃ prayaccha (2) sarvvadoṣaṃ nāśaya 
(2) manorathān pūraya (2) śrīpūrṇeśvarī re śrīviśveśvari

<p. 11a> śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || tato jihvāśodhanamaṃtra ||

<p. 12a> śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || tato śudarśanamaṃtra ||
sadaśaśa tarpayāyā ca śabdayukta varmāstrāṃtaḥ praṇavādikaśca bhavati || 
sudarśana maṃtrasyāhirbudhnya ṛṣiḥ anuṣṭupchandaḥ sudarśanarūpī 
viṣṇurdevatā sāṃ bījaṃ hūṁ śaktiḥ || ācakrāya svāhā || vicakrāya svāhā || 
sucakrāya svāhā || dhīcakrāya svāhā || saṃcakrāya svāhā || jvālācakrāya 
svāhā || iti ṣadaṃgamaṃtraṃ || guṇatrayāvaṣṭadhva sūrya

<p. 12b> somātmaka bhāvanayā praṇavaṃ śirasi vinyasya bhrumadhya vadana 
hṛdaya guhyajānupādeṣu ṣadvarṇān sakārādīn agnivarṇa bhāvanayā vinyaset || 
digbandhanamitthaṃ || 
aiṁ hrīṁ cakreṇa vadhnāni namaścakrāya svāhā || 
evamāgneyīṃ yāmyāṃ nai(-)ṛtya vāruṇīṃ vāyavīṃ kauberīṃ || maiśānīṃ || 
mūrddhāmadharāṃ iti pādānmuccārya diśaṃ cakrena vadhnāmi || 
namaścakrāya svāheti daśadigbandhaṃ kṛtvā

<p. 13a> trailokyaṃ rakṣa (2) hūṁ phaṭ svāheti maṃtreṇa svasya paritognimayaṃ 
prākāraṃ parikalpya mūlena pāvannirodha prāṇāyāma trayaṃ kṛtvā 
bhagavanmūrttiṃ dhyāyet || avyādbhāskara 
saprabhābhirakhilābhābhirddiśobhā sayanbhīmākṣa sphuradaṭṭahāsa 
vikasaddaṣṭrā pradīptānanaḥ ||
dorbhiścakradarau gadābja muśalatrāsāṃśvapāśāṃkuśau 
vibhratpiṃgaśiroruhotha bhavataścakrā dhāno hariḥ ||

<p. 13b> evaṃ saṃcityāṃtarārādhanaṃ kṛtvā bāhyapīṭhepyāvaraṇopetaṃ 
pūjayet || tatrāṃgaiḥ prathamāvaraṇaṃ || 
cakra śaṃkha gadā padma muśala prāsaṃ pāśāṃkuśai dvitīyā || 
lakṣmī sarasvatī rati prīti kīrtti kāṃti tuṣṭi 
puṣṭibhirjvālāvarṇābhipadmadvayāṃjalikarābhiḥ tṛtīyaṃ || 
indrādibhiścaturthaṃ || atra pūjāyāṃ bhagavatsānidhyārthaṃ 
śudarśanagātryā cakramudrāṃ pradarśayet ||
śudarśanāya

<p. 14a> vidmahe mahājvālāya dhīmahi tannaścakra pracodayāt ||
iti śudarśana gāyatrī || japa homādi karma prāraṃbha samayeṣu sarvarakṣārtha 
śudarśana mālā maṃtraṃ japet ||
oṃ namo bhagavate mahāśudarśanāya mahācakrāya mahājvālāya dīptarūpāya 
sarvato rakṣa (2) māṃ mahābalāya svāhā huṁ phat || 
asya mālāmaṃtrasya sudarśana ṣoḍaśākṣarasyāpi ṣadakṣara

<p. 14b> śudarśanamaṃtravat || maṃtranyāsa dhyāna pūjādikaṃ jñātavyaṃ ||

śrīgaṇeśāya namaḥ || 

tato garuḍapaṃcākṣarīmaṃtra ||
sa ca tṛtīya svara yuktakṣakārādipetyakṣaraḥ praṇavogni jāyāṃtaḥ ||
asya maṃtrasya ananto rudro vāk ṛṣiḥ paṅticchandaḥ pakṣīndro devatā praṇavo 
bījaṃ svāhā śaktiḥ 
oṃ jvala jvala mahāgati svāhā || garuḍāya namaḥ svāhā || garuḍāya śirasya 
svāhā || garuḍaprabhaṃjana (2) prabhedana (2) vinnāsaya (2) vimarddaya (2) svāhā || 
ugrarūpadhara sarvaviṣahara bhīṣaya (2) sarvaṃ daha (2) bhasmī kuru (2) svāhā || 
apratihata balāpratihata śā 




